Why: v0.36.0 treated app-menu membership as window ancestry, so a command addressed to one window could act on a sibling key window; require the addressed window to be the app's focused window before admitting an app-menu element.

Each regression has a focused unit test in this patch. No foreground action
is introduced; unknown target facts continue to fail closed.

